# Real data (Postgres incl. pgvector KB, Redis, MinIO, Caddy TLS certs) —
# bind-mounted here so the project directory is a self-contained, zippable
# deployment unit (see DEPLOYMENT.md). Never committed: this is where real
# student PII, financials, and the OpenRouter-touched knowledge base live.
/docker/

# Real secrets — copy from the committed *.example templates, never commit
# the filled-in file.
server/.env
server/.env.production
frontend/.env

node_modules/
dist/
dist-seed/
coverage/
*.log

# Output of deploy/package-data.sh — the actual data transfer artifact,
# never committed (same reasoning as /docker/ above).
docker-data.tar.gz
